cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KADEM: Kinematic-Kinetic Automated Data Extraction in Motion"
abstract: >-
  Desktop program that extracts event-based gait variables (kinematics, kinetics, ground reaction force,
  spatiotemporal parameters and EMG) from C3D files processed with Plug-in Gait and writes them to an
  Excel workbook for statistical analysis.
